1
00:00:05,542 --> 00:00:09,142
(Sheldon:)Hello, I'm Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

2
00:00:09,312 --> 00:00:12,772
Welcome to Sheldon Cooper Presents:
Fun With Flags.

3
00:00:16,319 --> 00:00:18,789
(Sheldon:)My apologies
that this episode is coming late.

4
00:00:18,955 --> 00:00:22,445
(Sheldon:)I did shoot one last week
in honor of Black History Month...

5
00:00:22,626 --> 00:00:25,716
(Sheldon:)...but I was informed by my roommate
that my spot-on portrayal...

6
00:00:25,929 --> 00:00:30,199
(Sheldon:)...of George Washington Carver
could be considered "wildly racist."

7
00:00:32,536 --> 00:00:35,866
(Sheldon:)My heart goes out to the members
of the African-American community...

8
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:39,129
(Sheldon:)...who, like me,
have been kept down by the man.

9
00:00:41,211 --> 00:00:45,671
(Sheldon:)Now, Fun With Flags
is not just for the flag aficionado...

10
00:00:45,849 --> 00:00:47,909
(Sheldon:)...it's also for the flag novice.

11
00:00:48,084 --> 00:00:52,884
(Sheldon:)So to help me with that, please welcome
my friend, neighbor and flag virgin...

12
00:00:53,056 --> 00:00:55,186
(Sheldon:)...not a real virgin.

13
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,850
(Sheldon:)She's had coitus many times.

14
00:01:00,830 --> 00:01:05,020
(Sheldon:)Sometimes within earshot
of this flag enthusiast.

